# SoftoMedia Live - AI Assistant Rules

## Critical Deployment Rules

### 1. Never Hardcode Configuration
- ❌ FORBIDDEN: Hardcoding API URLs, backend URLs, or env-specific values in components
- ✅ REQUIRED: Use `client-app/src/config.js` for all API URLs
- Example: `import { API_URL } from '../config.js'`

### 2. Service Deletion Requires Verification
- Before `gcloud run services delete`: ALWAYS run `gcloud run services list` first
- Confirm service URL matches deletion target
- Get explicit user approval with service name + URL
- Remember: Deleting a service deletes ALL revisions

### 3. Post-Deployment Seed is Mandatory
- After EVERY `gcloud builds submit`, immediately run:
  ```
  Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "https://ad-server-bi477lfjdq-uc.a.run.app/api/debug/seed"
  ```
- Verify response: `{"status":"seeded"}`

### 4. Verify GCS Assets
- When uploading to GCS, check file sizes to detect duplicates
- Visual inspection required: download and view at least one file
- All demo ad images must be unique

### 5. Check IAM After Every Deployment
- Run: `gcloud run services get-iam-policy SERVICE_NAME --region us-central1`
- If missing `allUsers → roles/run.invoker`, add it immediately

### 6. Cache Invalidation Required
- After deploying image or API changes, instruct user to hard refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R)
- Signed URLs cache for 60 minutes

### 7. Atomic Deployments Only
- ONLY deploy via: `gcloud builds submit --config cloudbuild.yaml .`
- NEVER manually delete or update individual Cloud Run services

### 8. GCS Bucket Must Be Publicly Readable
- After creating GCS bucket, immediately run:
  ```
  gcloud storage buckets add-iam-policy-binding gs://BUCKET_NAME --member=allUsers --role=roles/storage.objectViewer
  ```
- Without this, player will show black screens (images won't load)

### 9. Seed Endpoint Must Create Admin User
- NEVER rely only on `bootstrapAdmin()` server startup functions
- Always include admin user creation in `/api/debug/seed` endpoint:
  ```javascript
  const hashedPassword = await hashPassword('password');
  await usersRef.doc('admin_001').set({email, password: hashedPassword, role: 'admin'});
  ```
- Why: Server containers restart frequently; seed endpoint is guaranteed to run when called

