## Pre-Deployment Checklist
1. Run `node verify_predeploy.js` if it exists
2. Verify no hardcoded URLs in new code
3. Confirm GCS assets are unique (if modified)
4. Review `DEPLOYMENT_LOG.md` for past issues

## Post-Deployment Checklist
1. Run seed endpoint
2. Check IAM policy
3. Test in incognito mode
4. Verify both frontend + backend URLs work

